50 750 Td (Research Paper: An Introduction to Retrieval-Augmented Generation) Tj
50 750 Td () Tj
50 735 Td () Tj
50 735 Td () Tj
50 720 Td (Abstract:) Tj
50 720 Td () Tj
50 705 Td (Retrieval-Augmented Generation \(RAG\) combines the parametric knowledge of large language) Tj
50 705 Td () Tj
50 690 Td (models with non-parametric retrieval from external knowledge bases. This paper presents a) Tj
50 690 Td () Tj
50 675 Td (comprehensive overview of the RAG framework and its applications in natural language processing.) Tj
50 675 Td () Tj
50 660 Td () Tj
50 660 Td () Tj
50 645 Td (Introduction:) Tj
50 645 Td () Tj
50 630 Td (Large language models have demonstrated remarkable capabilities across a wide range of tasks.) Tj
50 630 Td () Tj
50 615 Td (However, these models are limited by their training data cutoff and may hallucinate facts.) Tj
50 615 Td () Tj
50 600 Td (Retrieval-augmented approaches address these limitations by grounding model outputs in) Tj
50 600 Td () Tj
50 585 Td (retrieved documents from external knowledge sources.) Tj
50 585 Td () Tj
50 570 Td () Tj
50 570 Td () Tj
50 555 Td (Methods:) Tj
50 555 Td () Tj
50 540 Td (We implement a dense retrieval system using FAISS for efficient approximate nearest neighbor) Tj
50 540 Td () Tj
50 525 Td (search over document embeddings. The retriever scores each candidate document against the) Tj
50 525 Td () Tj
50 510 Td (query using cosine similarity of dense vector representations.) Tj
50 510 Td () Tj
50 495 Td () Tj
50 495 Td () Tj
50 480 Td (Results:) Tj
50 480 Td () Tj
50 465 Td (Our experiments on knowledge-intensive NLP tasks demonstrate significant improvements over) Tj
50 465 Td () Tj
50 450 Td (baseline language models. The RAG system achieves higher factual accuracy and lower) Tj
50 450 Td () Tj
50 435 Td (hallucination rates compared to standard language model baselines.) Tj
50 435 Td () Tj
50 420 Td () Tj
50 420 Td () Tj
50 405 Td (Conclusion:) Tj
50 405 Td () Tj
50 390 Td (Retrieval-augmented generation represents a promising direction for building more reliable) Tj
50 390 Td () Tj
50 375 Td (and factually grounded language systems. Future work will explore dynamic retrieval) Tj
50 375 Td () Tj
50 360 Td (strategies and more efficient indexing methods for large-scale knowledge bases.) Tj
50 360 Td () Tj
